/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-2-// ONE call route for every callable: evaluate the callee to a VALUE (name lookup reaches
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-3-// builtins at the root; a cooled Attribute is a bound method), evaluate the args (the shared
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-4-// #evalArgs loop in core.k), then dispatch on the callee value:
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k:5://   closureVal    -> bind params, push a frame (user function)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-6-//   boundMethodV  -> applyMethod
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-7-//   builtinV      -> the #iterNext folds (sum/all/any/max/min) or applyBuiltin
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-8-//   typeV         -> callable type objects: int(...) / str(...)
--
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-66-       requires notBool isMutMethod(M) andBool notBool isRefV(OBJ)
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-67-       [priority(40)]
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-68-
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k:69:  rule <k> #applyK(toCall(closureVal(PNS:ParamNames, BODY:Stmts, DEFL:Int)), ACC:Vals) ~> CONT
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-70-        => #bindP(PNS, ACC) ~> BODY ~> #endcall </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-71-       <env>     CALLERL:Int => NEWL </env>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-72-       <scopes>   STORE:Map => STORE [ NEWL <- scope(.Map, parent(DEFL)) ] </scopes>
--
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-77-  // parent is the module scope (all enclosing-local reads go through cells),
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-78-  // and the cellvars' fresh cells allocate before params bind (a cellvar param
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-79-  // then writes through its cell in #bindP).
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k:80:  rule <k> #applyK(toCall(closureValC(PNS:ParamNames, CVS:ParamNames, BODY:Stmts, CM:Map)), ACC:Vals) ~> CONT
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-81-        => #allocCells(CVS) ~> #bindP(PNS, ACC) ~> BODY ~> #endcall </k>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-82-       <env>     CALLERL:Int => NEWL </env>
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-83-       <scopes>   STORE:Map => STORE [ NEWL <- scope(CM [ "$cells" <- cellsMark(CVS) ], parent(0)) ] </scopes>
